<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
            <h1 class="mb-4">Import ICS Calendar</h1>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <div class="alert alert-info mb-4">
                        <h4 class="alert-heading">Import Calendar Events</h4>
                        <p>Import events into your family calendar by uploading an ICS file or providing an ICS URL. ICS (iCalendar) is a standard format used by most calendar applications.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card import-card">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3" id="importTabs" role="tablist">
                              <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                                <button class="nav-link active" id="url-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#url-content" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="url-content" aria-selected="true">
                                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i> Import from URL
                                </button>
                              </li>
                                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                                    <button class="nav-link" id="file-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#file-content" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="file-content" aria-selected="false">
                                        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark"></i> Upload File
                                    </button>
                                </li>
