<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
            <h1 class="mb-4">Import ICS Calendar</h1>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <div class="alert alert-info mb-4">
                        <h4 class="alert-heading">Import Calendar Events</h4>
                        <p>Import events into your family calendar by uploading an ICS file or providing an ICS URL. ICS (iCalendar) is a standard format used by most calendar applications.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card import-card">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3" id="importTabs" role="tablist">
                              <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                                <button class="nav-link active" id="url-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#url-content" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="url-content" aria-selected="true">
                                    <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i> Import from URL
                                </button>
                              </li>
                                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                                    <button class="nav-link" id="file-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#file-content" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="file-content" aria-selected="false">
                                        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark"></i> Upload File
                                    </button>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="tab-content" id="importTabsContent">
                                <!-- URL Import Tab -->
                                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="url-content" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="url-tab">
                                    <form method="post" id="ics-url-form">
                                        {% csrf_token %}
                                        <input type="hidden" name="import_type" value="url">

                                        <div class="mb-3">
                                            <label for="account_name_url" class="form-label">Calendar Name</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="account_name_url" name="account_name" required>
                                            <div class="form-text">Give this calendar a name to identify it in your list of calendars.</div>

                                            <!-- AI Suggestions container -->
                                            <div id="suggestions-container" class="suggestions-container">
                                                <div class="suggestions-label">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-lightbulb me-1"></i>Suggested names:
                                                </div>
                                                <div id="suggestion-pills" class="suggestion-pills">
                                                    <!-- Suggestions will be inserted here -->
                                                </div>
                                                <div id="metadata-info" class="metadata-info" style="display: none;">
                                                    <!-- Metadata info will be shown here -->
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="mb-3">
                                            <label for="ics_url" class="form-label">ICS URL</label>
                                            <input type="url" class="form-control" id="ics_url" name="ics_url" placeholder="https://example.com/calendar.ics" required>
                                            <div class="form-text">Enter the URL of the ICS calendar feed.</div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="form-check mb-3">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="sync_enabled" name="sync_enabled" checked>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="sync_enabled">
                                                Enable automatic synchronization
                                            </label>
                                            <div class="form-text">If enabled, the calendar will be periodically synchronized with the URL.</div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="import-options">
                                            <div class="mb-3">
                                                <label class="form-label">Import Options</label>
                                                <div class="form-check">
                                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="skip_duplicates_url" name="skip_duplicates" checked>
                                                    <label class="form-check-label" for="skip_duplicates_url">
                                                        Skip duplicate events
                                                    </label>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                            {% include "calendars/_imported_visibility_alert.html" with source_label="feed URL" %}
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                                                <i class="bi bi-calendar-plus"></i> Import Calendar
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    </form>
                                </div>
                                                            <!-- File Upload Tab -->
                                                            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="file-content" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="file-tab">
                                                              <form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" id="ics-file-form">
                                                                  {% csrf_token %}
                                                                  <input type="hidden" name="import_type" value="file">

                                                                  <div class="mb-3">
                                                                      <label for="account_name_file" class="form-label">Calendar Name</label>
                                                                      <input type="text" class="form-control" id="account_name_file" name="account_name" required>
                                                                      <div class="form-text">Give this calendar a name to identify it in your list of calendars.</div>
                                                                  </div>

                                                                  <div class="file-upload-container" id="drop-area">
                                                                      <i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up file-upload-icon"></i>
                                                                      <div class="file-upload-text">
                                                                          <strong>Choose an ICS file</strong> or drag it here
                                                                      </div>
                                                                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="file-select-button">
                                                                          Select File
                                                                      </button>
                                                                      <input type="file" class="file-upload-input" id="ics_file" name="ics_file" accept=".ics" required>

                                                                      <div class="selected-file" id="selected-file-info">
                                                                          <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text"></i>
                                                                          <span id="file-name"></span>
                                                                          <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger float-end" id="remove-file">
                                                                              <i class="bi bi-x"></i>
                                                                          </button>
                                                                      </div>
                                                                  </div>

                                                                  <div class="import-options">
                                                                      <div class="mb-3">
                                                                          <label class="form-label">Import Options</label>
                                                                          <div class="form-check">
                                                                              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="skip_duplicates_file" name="skip_duplicates" checked>
                                                                              <label class="form-check-label" for="skip_duplicates_file">
                                                                                  Skip duplicate events
                                                                              </label>
                                                                          </div>
                                                                      </div>

                                                                      <div class="alert alert-info mb-3" role="alert">
                                                                          <input type="hidden" name="visibility" value="NONE">
                                                                          <strong>Sharing imported events:</strong>
                                                                          ICS events are added as Personal by default. To let family or connected network members see an imported event, change that event's visibility to Public after import. A public ICS file only lets ClanCal read the calendar data; it does not make imported events visible to others.
                                                                      </div>
                                                                  </div>

                                                                  <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                                                                      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="import-file-button" disabled>
                                                                          <i class="bi bi-calendar-plus"></i> Import Calendar
                                                                      </button>
                                                                  </div>
                                                              </form>
                                                          </div>
                              </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h5>Quick Actions</h5>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                                <a href="{% url 'calendars:external_calendar_list' %}" class="btn btn-outline-primary">Manage Calendars</a>
                                <a href="{% url 'event_bulk_select' %}" class="btn btn-outline-primary">Bulk Edit Existing Events</a>
                                <a href="{% url 'calendars:calendar' %}" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Back to Calendar</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h5>How to Get an ICS File or URL</h5>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h6>Google Calendar</h6>
                            <p>For file: Settings > Export > Export this calendar</p>
                            <p>For URL: Settings > Calendar Settings > Integrate calendar > Secret address in iCal format</p>

                            <h6>Apple Calendar</h6>
                            <p>For file: Select a calendar > File > Export > Export...</p>
                            <p>For URL: Right-click calendar > Share Calendar > Public Calendar</p>

                            <h6>Microsoft Outlook</h6>
                            <p>For file: File > Save Calendar > Save as iCalendar (.ics)</p>
                            <p>For URL: Share > Publish This Calendar > Select permissions > Get a link</p>

                            <h6>Other Calendars</h6>
                            <p>Most calendar applications support exporting to ICS format or sharing via URL. Look for Export, Share, or Publishing options.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
